# Vercel reads .vercelignore from the project Root Directory (= 13-0/), NOT the
# repo root — so the build-suppression excludes must live HERE. Removing the
# Node manifest makes this a pure static deploy: no npm install, no build step,
# no flaky NOT_FOUND. (@vercel/analytics is loaded via /_vercel/insights/script.js,
# served by the platform when Web Analytics is on — the npm package isn't needed.)
package.json
package-lock.json
node_modules
